WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:01.800
Someone

00:01.880 --> 00:03.280
Bring me my sword

00:04.480 --> 00:05.880
Yes

00:10.880 --> 00:11.720
This reform

00:11.880 --> 00:13.280
Since it has begun

00:13.400 --> 00:15.733
Must be carried through to the end

00:21.760 --> 00:23.760
Have someone deliver this sword to Xie Xuan

00:23.840 --> 00:25.840
Whoever dares obstruct the new policies

00:27.200 --> 00:28.160
I authorize him

00:28.240 --> 00:29.800
To execute first and report later

00:30.800 --> 00:39.800
Fast horses galloped out of the capital that very night, rushing the imperial sword to Qingzhou. Bearing the Son of Heaven's blade, Xie Xuan executed more than ten powerful nobles including Count of Yun County Qiu Sheng, cowing the other aristocratic clans into silence, and the new laws were smoothly implemented thereafter.

00:40.800 --> 00:45.800
Yet before long, a relentless blizzard of memorials impeaching Xie Xuan flooded into the court, piling onto the Emperor's desk.

00:46.800 --> 00:51.800
The aristocratic clans across multiple regions united to form a grand army, vowing to execute Xie Xuan to purge the court of treachery.

00:52.200 --> 00:56.800
The allied aristocratic forces advanced upon the imperial city along three separate routes.

00:57.200 --> 01:05.800
You immediately dispatched urgent orders for Zu Yue to mobilize troops and crush the rebellion, unaware that the Wunu would seize this chance to invade south, pinning Zu Yue firmly to the northern bank of the Tianhe River...
